:: Water Dragon Lab Daily Serum Trance
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>><<speechresolve>><<npc Harper>><<person1>>
<<if $settings.hypnosisEnabled>>
	Harper moves the pen slowly from side to side. You follow it with your eyes while <<he>> speaks in a steady voice.
	"Good, now get onto the chair. Put your knees apart and rest your legs on the supports.
